          "name": "get_lifecycle_notices_flow",
          "description": "List change notices (PCN) and end-of-life notices (EOL): pcn_id, part, type, title, the full notice text, published / effective / last-time-buy dates, replacement part, the buyer's open lines on that part (quantity and promised date) and whether the account is subscribed. Pass a part_number for one part, or leave it empty for every notice on parts the account has open orders for or subscribes to.",
