            "handlerName": "open_service_case",
            "handlerDescription": "Hand a request that needs a person to the right Arcwell team. request_type is last_time_buy (reference_id = the proposal_id of the LARGE_LAST_TIME_BUY propose_order result), factory_expedite (reference_id = the line_ref, requested_date = the date the buyer needs, YYYY-MM-DD), credit_review (amount = the credit limit asked for in dollars, or empty to ask only for a credit-hold release), or special_pricing (price match or special price; reference_id = the part number if known). summary is a neutral 1-3 sentence summary in the buyer's own words. Leave fields empty when they do not apply. The system routes it and returns OPENED with case_id, team and reply time, EXISTING, or BLOCKED / INVALID_TYPE with a reason. RMAs are not opened here (use propose_rma). The assistant never decides, promises or predicts the outcome. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
