        {
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "decide_review_case",
            "handlerDescription": "Record the reviewer's decision on a case in their team queue - only after the reviewer explicitly confirmed the restated decision. decision is APPROVE or REJECT; amount is what is approved in the case's amount_unit (RMA: credit in dollars; last-time-buy: quantity in pieces; credit review: the new credit limit in dollars; empty = the full requested amount; ignored for REJECT and for cases without an amount); internal_note is required (at least 5 characters, never shown to the customer); customer_message is what the buyer will see. Approving runs the parked action (credit memo, last-time-buy order, factory expedite or credit change) through the system's checks. Returns APPROVED / REJECTED with executed_action, or BLOCKED with reason_code NOT_YOUR_TEAM, ALREADY_DECIDED, NOTE_REQUIRED, AMOUNT_INVALID, OVER_AUTHORITY (case stays open for a senior reviewer), ACTION_BLOCKED or NOT_FOUND, or NOT_REVIEWER. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
            "toolTitle": "",
            "readOnlyToolHint": false,
            "destructiveToolHint": false,
            "idempotentToolHint": false,
            "openWorldToolHint": false,
