        "name": "verify_buyer_flow",
        "description": "Verify a buyer at an Arcwell customer account with the account number (AC-10021, ac10021 or 10021 all work), the buyer&#39;s e-mail address on file and the one-time code e-mailed to them. Returns VERIFIED with a session_token (valid 60 minutes), the buyer&#39;s first name and company, VERIFY_FAILED, or LOCKED after too many failed attempts. Call this before any buyer tool. Never reveal, guess or hint at codes. Arcwell staff use verify_reviewer instead. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
