    {
      "id": "flow:request_expedite_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "request_expedite_flow",
        "description": "Pull in the ship date of one of the verified buyer&#39;s unshipped order lines. Pass the line_ref from get_my_orders (e.g. SO-2026-0014/1) and the new date (YYYY-MM-DD). The system checks the line is the buyer&#39;s, not shipped, that the date is in the future and earlier than the promised date, and that stock or confirmed supply can meet it. Returns EXPEDITED with a reference (EXP-...) and the new promised date, or BLOCKED with a reason - FACTORY_EXPEDITE_REQUIRED gives the earliest date possible without the factory (offer open_service_case factory_expedite for anything earlier). Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
        "links": [
